{
  "id": "DOC-18-Tc89ba",
  "title": "Text: DET Greg Garno ↔ Anthony Fenech",
  "date": "2018-05-09",
  "from": "DET Greg Garno",
  "to": "Anthony Fenech",
  "type": "text",
  "subjects": [],
  "content": [
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:31 AM",
      "text": "How much would I have to pay you to RT the Tigers lineup from @tigers?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:36 AM",
      "text": "How much would I have to pay you to RT the Tigers lineup from @tigers?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:41 AM",
      "text": "Not happening"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:42 AM",
      "text": "Well, it doesn’t hurt to ask lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:42 AM",
      "text": "Lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:42 AM",
      "text": "Why"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:42 AM",
      "text": "I thought you were asking as a joke"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:43 AM",
      "text": "I spelled Mahtook’s name wrong the first time and I want to make sure this is the one spread around, not the other. More people that share this means people forget about that older version.."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:43 AM",
      "text": "Ok"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:45 AM",
      "text": "❤️ you mean it"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:20 PM",
      "text": "Liked “❤️ you mean it”"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:20 PM",
      "text": "I didn't mean to sound like a dick lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:20 PM",
      "text": "Lol all good"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:21 PM",
      "text": "And really, I'm more anti-Tigers PR"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:21 PM",
      "text": "I saw Ben when I stopped by DC"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:21 PM",
      "text": "Ben was in DC?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:21 PM",
      "text": "[Attachment: Image]"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:22 PM",
      "text": "LOLOL"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:22 PM",
      "text": "That’s him in 10 years"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:24 PM",
      "text": "Lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:24 PM",
      "text": "What a lineup today"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:25 PM",
      "text": "Split squad in Dunedin!"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:25 PM",
      "text": "Lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:25 PM",
      "text": "Do you know Ryan Schuiling?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:26 PM",
      "text": "No, but he's one of those Jeff Moss cronies that used to harass me and shit"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:26 PM",
      "text": "Then he asked me to come on his show"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:27 PM",
      "text": "Ok, that makes sense. He tweeted that the Tigers lineup was bad and that we made it worse by missing an O in Mahtook’s name"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:27 PM",
      "text": "Like, it’s one thing to at usband say “Hey you got it right!” I deserve that. The screenshot is just petty."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:11 PM",
      "text": "I just saw it"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:11 PM",
      "text": "Oof"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:13 PM",
      "text": "Some mid-40's radio hack not even in a major market"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "3:15 PM",
      "text": "Right. He’s one of the most annoying people that hops in our mentions. Never has anything nice to say."
    }
  ]
}